{"title":"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many zeros are at the end of the product\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/c/8ecd299812638ef3512de02d51d7e0f064dc7410.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[25\\times 25\\times 25\\times 25\\times 25\\times 25\\times 25\\times 8\\times 8\\times 8?\\]\" width=\"362\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/e/6bece4ba8d8809a2ebdb362a7725de079256feb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 3 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 6 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 9 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 10 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"348\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/6/af6824e903cc1de898e32eb201093b39c0e6d7cc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} (5^2)^7\\times (2^3)^3 &amp;=  5^{14}\\times 2^{9} \\\\ &amp;= 5^5\\times 10^9  \\end{align*}\" width=\"184\" height=\"43\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/1/0e1baff6050db5d3e78ff320d0358d74adf9b153.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"17\" /> doesn't end in a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we can conclude that the product ends in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> zeroes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/0/02076c6f1fc41e3892111b067c6552346e510f09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\rightarrow \\boxed{\\text{C}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"47\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME\" title=\"1991 AJHSME\">1991 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1991\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\